Package: appforge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Description: desktop installer for portable Linux applications
 AppForge installs AppImage, tar.gz, and Debian application packages from a
 graphical desktop interface. It creates desktop launchers and tracks user
 installations for safe removal.
